{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792505400, "covers_from": "2026-10-20T14:10:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-20T14:11:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792505460, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-20T14:10:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15215, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "我曾在北市工作過4年（阿扁年代），當年很自豪身為市府員工，但近10年來只往高雄跑，台北市只剩空殼了", "display_name": "中山代表 No.15,215", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T14:10:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2787, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "士東市場附近街道，蟑螂好多，每天晚上走路都提心弔膽～", "display_name": "士林代表 No.2,787", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T14:10:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 19165, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "推動全市人車分號誌，不要把路口人車矛盾留給市民", "display_name": "大安代表 No.19,165", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T14:10:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 32280, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我覺得在大巨蛋看到老鼠很噁心", "display_name": "文山代表 No.32,280", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T14:10:37+00:00", "duration_seconds": 23, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28828, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "我是環保稽查員，出勤跟警察一樣時常暴露在危險的狀況，但我們夜班只有200元的夜點費，沒人要來報到很慘", "display_name": "大同代表 艾瑞克", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 2787, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.2,787", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 19165, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.19,165", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": tr